<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Novellus upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Novellus upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex. Brown said on Tuesday it raised its rating on the shares of Novellus Systems Inc to buy from market perform.  </p>
<p>-- Analyst Byron Walker said the company had been very aggressive about taking one-time charges following new acquisitions, which cleared the way for &quot;unencumbered&quot; earnings going forward.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We expect to see a continued gradual improvement in orders, and these stocks tend to rise with orders,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>-- Walker also said DRAM (dynamic random access memory) makers were continuing to spend during the industry downturn, postponing the risk they would cut spending as memory chip prices softened for several quarters.</p>
<p>-- The stock firmed 1-15/16 to 96-11/16.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
